WEBVTT


00:00:00.020 --> 00:00:02.320
Banks just spent a trillion dollars on AI,

00:00:02.940 --> 00:00:04.880
not for chatbots, for an edge.

00:00:05.140 --> 00:00:07.440
Every major bank now trades with AI.

00:00:07.620 --> 00:00:11.020
JP Morgan runs over 450 AI systems across 200,000 people.

00:00:11.021 --> 00:00:12.961
Goldman built into the trading floor.

00:00:13.180 --> 00:00:15.360
Morgan Stanley runs open AI across the whole firm.

00:00:15.420 --> 00:00:18.040
They read macro structure and liquidity and milliseconds.

00:00:18.320 --> 00:00:19.420
No fear, no greed,

00:00:19.421 --> 00:00:20.521
no revenge trades

00:00:21.020 --> 00:00:22.920
the biggest edge in markets right now.

00:00:23.300 --> 00:00:25.240
So I built one that trades like the institutions.

00:00:25.420 --> 00:00:27.744
Comment the word bot and I'll send you how it works.
